<description>&lt;p&gt;Iranian drones have repeatedly struck Kurdish opposition camps and bases in Iraq, while Iranian-backed militias accuse the US of violating Iraqi airspace and Baghdad investigates suspected Israeli strikes. Iraq has responded by closing Iran border crossings and securing its frontier with Saudi Arabia, amid protests over the closures. Kurdish groups and Iranian forces continue to exchange attacks, and regional tensions are heightened by accusations of Israeli and US involvement. The conflict has resulted in 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE1nbElWUDJJc0xxNWlvQ2k1eUhBY2ZlWFNGZTh2QzgwWS1QU01BMFB6MUR2ckVHRVhBbDhwQkJHQnpGeDRTYkNjNGhFbW1iV1BWQlJ5RG5rY1c0OERx?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE1EUXN0TTM4cHhlVzlNMVpEVFlZUUNYSjR4cWZfdXVFam1WSVJSb3BZYmpSVHF6cENUTDc5N2VMdW1MczJLQWNtQ29JRHBVQnBVNm1FS1d2VnllQUFX?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة الانباء العراقية (واع)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxPNlBadWVlY1V5TFFpcjUyNUoyTjE2SGpXcC1qLXJiUm9IU3ZMWm5qd0QtMFREWXRxeGE3ZEx6eEZnVTVjWlc0dEdPZF8tMTN3R1RKRXA3RVZCQktfUmFrb2hRdy1fYzE1UDZPLXRZU01fX0MtZTNqTXg1cWdxNW5pN2RhYUJCX2wyLV9VLXVKeE5RZnU2NVhXQUYzVnV1bm11MVVMUjdFY1lhb21QX1k2Uld5azhTMk5hLXYtSGJhbDBjU01janhIQmtuYzFYQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Media Line&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQSERtU0tYdFU2ZTRRSXVRc0p4TjFNVXNRV3F0QW1Hcl9zVTlMY3lnTGtZM3JkaTBVdU9IRjV1bGNtbEFUSVdfbUxMRWk0UTFDdmVJTDR4cEdxWm1fS